# ProjectZ window materials.
# A material whose NAME starts with 'stuff' is tinted by the building's stuff colour and its Kd is
# forced to white (IsoRim Models.cs:1774/1780), so the colour has to come from map_Kd + tint.
newmtl stuff_wall
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
# ProjectZ/WindowWall{stuff} -> WindowWallWood / WindowWallMetal / WindowWallStone / WindowWallRock:
# copies of IsoRim's own wall side textures (MIT, see the mod's LICENSE), tinted by the stuff
# colour exactly like the wall blocks next to it.
map_Kd ProjectZ/WindowWall{stuff}

# Not 'stuff*': a fixed dark frame, so it keeps this Kd instead of being forced white.
newmtl frame_dark
Kd 0.420 0.360 0.280

newmtl glass_plain
Kd 0.700 0.800 0.860
